{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WARLANCER Armored Survivor is a single player top down shooter where you play as a freelancing mercenary completing capture and bounty missions while fighting of endless waves of alien invaders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your chosen weapon levels up, you gain access to the ability to equip another weapon to that weapon, allowing the first weapon to fire the second weapon on hit. Chain multiple weapons together to unleash untold levels of destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Incremental level up / upgrade system with multiple weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Temporary field powerups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Map objectives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ion Cannons and Bigass Drills</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646650/extras/ec98319edb8bb3768ad9fed7cea48ee7.poster.avif?t=1752836651\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646650/extras/ec98319edb8bb3768ad9fed7cea48ee7.webm?t=1752836651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646650/extras/ec98319edb8bb3768ad9fed7cea48ee7.mp4?t=1752836651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2646650?t=1752836651","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646650/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752836651","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646650/7f52199ef49fc4a858074b806753024520200941/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752836651","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.stea